# CLIo logo
# The word as a command line in a little terminal window, with the
# three window buttons and a blinking block cursor (the 'blink'
# attribute; terminals that do not blink just show the block). 28x7.
# Animated: the word is typed at the prompt (@frame drawings).
@palette
a=#5c6370
b=#ff5f57
c=#febc2e
d=#28c840
e=#7f8796
f=#5fd7ff
g=#b8f4ff
h=#8ce6ff
i=#ffd23f
j=#5af78e b
k=#2fa8ff
l=#2f6bff
m=#2f8aff
n=#ffa51a
o=#d9700a
p=#e6e6e6 blink
q=#5fd7ff b
r=#ffd23f b
s=#e6e6e6
@effect frames reveal=1
@fps 9
@art
╭──────────────────────────╮
│ ● ● ●              clio  │
├──────────────────────────┤
│   ▄▀▀ █   ▀█▀  ▄▄        │
│ > ▀▄▄ █▄▄ ▄█▄ ▀▄▄▀ █     │
│                          │
╰──────────────────────────╯
