aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
a b c d              eeee  a
aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
a   fgg h   ghg  ii        a
a j kll mll lml noon p     a
a                          a
aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
